  "meta": {
    "description": "Agent tool. Returns up to maxSlotsOffered (market row, default three) bookable DealerBook slots for a dealer from a date. Inputs: sessionId (plumbed), dealerId, fromDate (YYYY-MM-DD), serviceType. Side effect: stores the offered slots on the session so BookAppointment can validate the choice."
  },
